<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">Hello {{.Data.name}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">{{with index .Data "kind"}}{{if eq . "phone_verified"}}The mobile number ending in {{index $.Data "phone_hint"}} was verified and added to your Koro account.{{else if eq . "phone_removed"}}The mobile number ending in {{index $.Data "phone_hint"}} was removed from your Koro account; the SMS sign-in step is off too.{{else if eq . "sms_mfa_enabled"}}Two-step sign-in by SMS was turned on for your Koro account: sign-ins will send a code to the number ending in {{index $.Data "phone_hint"}}.{{else if eq . "sms_mfa_disabled"}}Two-step sign-in by SMS was turned off for your Koro account.{{else if eq . "sms_reset_limit"}}There were too many requests or tries to reset the password of your Koro account by SMS in the last 24 hours. For your security, the password can be reset by e-mail only for now.{{else if eq . "sms_reset_enabled"}}Password reset by SMS was turned on for your Koro account: starting seven days from now, a reset code can go to the number ending in {{index $.Data "phone_hint"}}.{{else if eq . "sms_reset_disabled"}}Password reset by SMS was turned off for your Koro account. You can reset your password by e-mail.{{else}}The phone number settings of your Koro account changed.{{end}}{{end}}</p>
<p style="margin:0;">If this was not you, <a href="{{index .Data "link"}}" style="color:#1d4ed8;">reset your password now</a>.</p>
